      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-17T16:55:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anyone have examples of games where the characters were right, and it should have been an easy win, but you somehow couldn't pull it off, no matter how many times you tried?</p><p>Last night that was me with DW Mr. Fixer, Omnitron-X, and Skyscraper versus Proletariat, Ambuscade, and Biomancer in the Realm of Discord. &nbsp;Fixer had all the right tools and styles and plenty of spare Links to blow up, and Glamour wasn't even present until late game, so I could use AoE safely. &nbsp;<span>I just couldn't pull it off after several attempts.</span></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:18.587Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
