      "id": 206532,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-18T18:57:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just ran into one that I figured would be a bit challenging, but managable: Dark Visionary and Dark Watch vs. Hammer &amp; Anvil and the four easiest team villains I could think of: Miss Information, The Operative, Greazer, and Challenge Mode Fright Train, in The Block.&nbsp; Then they sprang Leo's Trap and it was all over.&nbsp; The only way that team has of destroying a target by means other than reducing it to 0 HP was Tire Iron, but that still requires that damage be dealt, and Fright Train was already at 2 HP, so all damage to him was prevented, and no villain target other than him could be damaged.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:36:01.980Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
