      "cooked": "<p>Just played against Skinwalker Gloomweaver in the Block.&nbsp; His first card plays, in order, were Zombie Servant....x5, Strenght of the Grave, then the lady who pulls zombies out of the trash.&nbsp; A bit later, he plays 2 cards (because a target died in the Block, and then his turn occurred).&nbsp; It was 2 Profane Zealots...&nbsp; We couldn't get rid of the Pouch of Bones because zombies kept coming back to heal it.&nbsp; Plus, our team was PW Captain Cosmic (first to fall), NightMist (last to fall), Scholar (second-to-last to fall), and Ra (second to fall).</p><p>*Edit - Forgot to mention that this was a multi-player game on Steam.</p>",
